cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or computational model, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "Diabetic Kidney Latent Reserve Model"

type: software

authors:
  - name: "Prihantini"

abstract: >-
  A reproducible mathematical and computational for modelling
  latent renal reserve potential in diabetes using coupled nonlinear
  ordinary differential equations, dynamic risk surfaces, latent-state
  classification, uncertainty and sensitivity analysis, and sequential
  decision modelling.

repository-code: "https://github.com/TitinPrihantini4/diabetic-kidney-latent-reserve-model"

license: MIT

version: 1.0.0

keywords:
  - diabetic kidney disease
  - renal reserve
  - mathematical modelling
  - computational medicine
  - dynamical systems
  - dynamic risk surface
  - sensitivity analysis
  - uncertainty quantification
  - optimal stopping
